cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Fiberpose in scientific work, please cite the preprint."
title: "Fiberpose"
abstract: >-
  Fiberpose is research software for instance segmentation and quantitative
  morphometry of fibrous microstructures in microscopy images. A neural network
  predicts a distance-transform field, which is used for centerline extraction,
  fiber instance segmentation, and measurement of fiber diameter, orientation,
  porosity, and pore size.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Balashov
    given-names: Viktor A.
  - family-names: Antonenko
    given-names: Daniil S.
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/vikba/Fiberpose"
url: "https://fiberpose.org"
keywords:
  - fiber segmentation
  - instance segmentation
  - fiber diameter
  - fiber orientation
  - morphometry
  - microscopy
  - scanning electron microscopy
  - nanofibers
  - distance transform
  - deep learning
  - image analysis
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "Fiberpose: state-of-the-art fiber morphometry and instance segmentation with a distance-transform neural network"
  authors:
